Description: Finds and installs PSR-7, PSR-17, PSR-18 and HTTPlug implementations
 Runtime discovery mechanism that locates installed PSR-7/PSR-17/PSR-18
 HTTP message/factory/client implementations (e.g. nyholm/psr7) so
 libraries do not have to hard-depend on one specific implementation.
 Used by the OpenTelemetry PHP SDK's OTLP exporter.
